; ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
;   HEXE  ──  DEMO  Script  v2
;   Opening chat  →  Tutorial  →  Map (Mel / Eupie)
;   Mel result: ATK up  ／  Eupie result: DEF up
; ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════

@set PlayerName="Traveler"

@stopBgm
@bgm happy
@back bg01 time:0.5

; ── Opening ─────────────────────────────────────

@char 涅莉 pos:50 time:0
涅莉.happy: Hey, {PlayerName}! Welcome to Witch Club!
涅莉.happy: This is a special demo version made for the TGS SELECTED INDIE 80 review.
涅莉.happy: Witch Club is a story of girls rediscovering themselves after a great witch war.


@char 魅兒 pos:30 time:0.3
@char 優菲 pos:70 time:0.3


優菲.smile: And you — the skull I purchased — carry a mysterious power from another world.
魅兒.idle: The four of us are close friends, yet rivals from different factions. Whose side you lend your strength to — that's your choice.

涅莉.yummy: Alright, time is short. Let's go over how battles work first!

@choice Start!
@stop

@hide 涅莉,魅兒,優菲

; ── Tutorial ──────────────────────────────────────
@stopBgm
@bgm tutorial
@tutorial scriptName:demo label:after_tutorial background:bg01
@stop


; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# after_tutorial
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

@stopBgm
@bgm happy
@back bg01 time:0.5
@char 涅莉 pos:50 time:0

涅莉.exc: Starting to get the hang of it!

@choice Go!
@stop

@hide 涅莉

; ── Day map (Mel and Eupie only) ────────────────────
@GotoMapDemo ReturnScript:demo ReturnLabel:aftermap Scene:MapTest
@stop


; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# result_mei
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

@stopBgm
@bgm sad
@back bg01 time:0.5
@char 魅兒 pos:50 time:0

魅兒.idle: Not bad — you've grasped the essence of blood magic.
魅兒.talking: The more cards of the same color, the harder the hit. That's the secret to boosting attack power.

@choice Understood!
@stop

@hide 魅兒

; ── Rune station, then night map ────────────────
@GotoChangeRune scriptName:demo label:rune_tutorial
@stop


; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# result_euphie
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

@stopBgm
@bgm peace
@back bg02 time:0.5
@char 優菲 pos:50 time:0

優菲.smile: See that? The more blue cards you stack, the thicker the shield.
優菲.talk: The key to boosting defense is the same — matching card colors.

@choice "Now I see!"
@stop

@hide 優菲

; ── Rune station, then night map ────────────────
@GotoChangeRune scriptName:demo label:rune_tutorial
@stop


; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# rune_tutorial
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

@stopBgm
@bgm chill
@back bg01 time:0.5
@char 涅莉 pos:50 time:0

涅莉.yummy: How does the new rune feel?
涅莉.exc: Different runes completely change your battle style! Take this power with you —
涅莉.happy: Head to the night map and challenge even stronger foes!

@choice Onward!
@stop

@hide 涅莉

; ── Night map (Nelly / Vedia / Lilina) ────────────────────
@GotoMapDemo ReturnScript:demo ReturnLabel:aftermap Scene:MapTest IsDay:0
@stop


; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# aftermap
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

@stopBgm
@bgm intense
@back bg01 time:0.5
@char 涅莉 pos:50 time:0

涅莉.happy: How was it? The new rune feels great, right!
涅莉.yummy: Now's your chance — give this combination a try!

@hide 涅莉
@set RuneActive=true
@battle background:bg01 target:monster03 scriptName:demo label:afterpractice
@stop


; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# afterpractice
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

@stopBgm
@bgm stardust
@back bg02 time:0.5
@char 魅兒 pos:20 time:0.3
@char 優菲 pos:40 time:0.3
@char 涅莉 pos:60 time:0.3
@char 薇狄亞 pos:80 time:0.3

魅兒.idle: Not bad — you've improved.
優菲.smile: But... the strength of one person can only go so far.
涅莉.exc: Together is where true power lives!
薇狄亞.talking: The four of us united — that's what Witch Club is.

@hide 魅兒,優菲,涅莉,薇狄亞

@set RuneActive=true
@battle background:bg03 target:monster03 scriptName:demo label:finalending
@stop


; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# finalending
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

@stopBgm
@bgm fantasy
@back bg02 time:1
@char 魅兒 pos:20 time:0.3
@char 優菲 pos:40 time:0.3
@char 涅莉 pos:60 time:0.3
@char 薇狄亞 pos:80 time:0.3

魅兒.talking: This is our power.
優菲.smile: Thank you for coming to Witch Club.
涅莉.happy: The full game has even more adventures waiting for you!
薇狄亞.idle: Don't forget us — I know we'll meet again.

@hide 魅兒,優菲,涅莉,薇狄亞

@stopBgm
@GotoUnityScene SceneName:SelectLanguage
@stop
